      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PiP Area Under Pointer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PiP 鼠标下方的区域"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PiP Current Window": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PiP 当前窗口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PiP Gestures": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小窗操作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PiP Window": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小窗"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PiP ended: capture stopped unexpectedly. You can PiP this window again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PiP 已结束：画面抓取意外停止，可以再 PiP 一次这个窗口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PiP ended: macOS stopped capturing because the source window isn't on the current desktop (it's minimized or on another desktop). Restore it and PiP it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PiP 已结束：原窗口不在当前桌面（最小化或在其他桌面）时系统停止了抓取，恢复原窗口后再 PiP 一次"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PipDog Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PipDog 设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PipDog needs %@ permission": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PipDog 需要「%@」权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PipDog runs in the menu bar. Click the menu bar icon %@ or use a shortcut to start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PipDog 在菜单栏运行，点击菜单栏图标 %@ 或使用快捷键开始"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press a Shortcut… (Esc to Cancel)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请按快捷键…（Esc 取消）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quick Look": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快速查看"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quick Look failed: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快速查看失败：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quick Look failed: the source window can't be captured right now. Try again later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快速查看失败：原窗口暂时无法截图，请稍后再试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quit PipDog": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退出 PipDog"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Registered. Allow PipDog in System Settings › General › Login Items & Extensions so it opens at login.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已登记，还需要在「系统设置 › 通用 › 登录项与扩展」里允许 PipDog，开机时才会启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Relaunch Now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "立即重新启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Relaunch PipDog": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新启动 PipDog"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Relaunch PipDog to use the new language?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新启动 PipDog 以使用新的语言？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Relaunch Required": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需重新启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reopen anytime from Welcome Guide… in the menu.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以后可以从菜单「使用说明…」再看"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reset zoom": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复原大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Resize": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rest the pointer on a PiP for about 1.5 s to fade it out; press ⌥ alone to bring it back": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "鼠标停在小窗上约 1.5 秒会淡出，单独按一下 ⌥ 恢复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore Defaults": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复默认"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Screen & System Audio Recording": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "屏幕与系统录音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Screen Recording": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "屏幕录制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⌘-scroll / pinch": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⌘ 滚动 / 捏合"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select Region to PiP": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "框选区域"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shortcuts": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快捷键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows live content; requested on your first PiP": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实时显示画面，第一次 PiP 时请求"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some shortcuts aren't working: %@. Choose another combination in PipDog Settings, or use the menu for now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快捷键没有生效：%@。请在 PipDog 设置里换一个组合，或先从菜单使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some windows couldn't be moved back when PipDog last quit and may still be at the screen edge.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次退出时有窗口没能移回原位，可能还在屏幕边上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some windows were still at the screen edge when PipDog last quit. Moving them back needs Accessibility permission.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次退出时有窗口还在屏幕边上，移回需要辅助功能权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Source app is hidden; picture paused\nClick the PiP to resume": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原 app 已隐藏，画面暂停\n单击小窗恢复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Source app is hidden; picture paused\nDouble-click the PiP to resume": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原 app 已隐藏，画面暂停\n双击小窗恢复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Source window is minimized; picture paused\nRestore it from the Dock to continue": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原窗口已最小化，画面暂停\n从程序坞恢复原窗口后继续"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch Back / Park": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切回 / 移到旁边"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch to source window": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切回原窗口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The frontmost app": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最前面的 app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The language changes after PipDog relaunches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新启动 PipDog 后才会切换语言。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The region is too small (at least %lld×%lld), so no PiP was opened": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "区域太小（至少 %1$lld×%2$lld），没有打开 PiP"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The second click is kept from the app. Needs Accessibility; without it, PipDog only observes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "触发用的第二次点击不会传给目标 app。需要辅助功能权限，没有时只能旁观。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The source window was closed, so the PiP ended": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原窗口已关闭，PiP 已结束"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The window of “%@” is at the screen edge. To move it back, turn on PipDog in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Accessibility": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」的窗口在屏幕边上，移回需要在「系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 辅助功能」里打开 PipDog"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There's no window on screen to PiP": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "屏幕上没有可以 PiP 的窗口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There's no window under the pointer to PiP": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "鼠标下方没有可以 PiP 的窗口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There's no window under the selection to PiP": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选区下方没有可以 PiP 的窗口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This shortcut": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该快捷键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tip: macOS treats a ⌃-click as a right-click, so the app may show its shortcut menu on the first click.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提示：按住 ⌃ 点击时 macOS 会把第一次点击当成右键，目标 app 可能弹出右键菜单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To move “%@” to the screen edge and keep its picture updating, turn on PipDog in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Accessibility": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要把「%@」移到屏幕旁边并保持画面更新，需要在「系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 辅助功能」里打开 PipDog"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on PipDog in System Settings › Privacy & Security › %@, then click “Relaunch PipDog”. The permission status may take a moment to update; you can relaunch even if it still shows as not granted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在「系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › %@」里打开 PipDog，再点「重新启动 PipDog」。授权状态可能延迟刷新；即使仍显示未授权，也可以重新启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on PipDog in System Settings › Privacy & Security › %@, then relaunch PipDog (try PiP again or click the permission status in the menu)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在「系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › %@」里打开 PipDog，然后重新启动 PipDog（再试一次 PiP 或点菜单里的权限状态）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on PipDog in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Accessibility": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在「系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 辅助功能」里打开 PipDog"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@ (%@)\nTurn any window, or part of one, into a live floating window that stays on top.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本 %1$@（%2$@）\n把任意窗口或其中一块区域变成置顶的实时小窗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome Guide…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用说明…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to PipDog": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "欢迎使用 PipDog"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zoom in": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "放大画面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zoom to selection": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "框选放大"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "couldn't create the snapshot": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法生成截图"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "list.separator": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ", "
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "、"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the previous snapshot isn't finished yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上一张截图还没完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the source window can't be captured right now (it may be minimized or hidden). Try again later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原窗口暂时无法截图（可能已最小化或被隐藏），请稍后再试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the source window is closed or not visible": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原窗口已关闭或不可见"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "this PiP has no picture yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个小窗还没有画面，暂时无法截图"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "turn off": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "turn on": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "× at top left": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "左上角 ×"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” has no window to PiP": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」没有可以 PiP 的窗口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” has quit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」已经退出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is already in front. To switch to this window, give PipDog Accessibility permission in System Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」已在前台；要切到这个窗口，需要在系统设置里给 PipDog 辅助功能权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⌘ or ⌘⇧ with a regular key would take over common shortcuts like ⌘C, ⌘Q and ⌘W. Add ⌃ or ⌥ (F1–F20 are fine).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只用 ⌘ 或 ⌘⇧ 加普通按键会抢走 ⌘C、⌘Q、⌘W 这类常用快捷键，请再加上 ⌃ 或 ⌥（F1–F20 除外）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⌘-double-click": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⌘ 双击"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⌘-drag": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⌘ 拖动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⌥-click": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⌥ 单击"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reduce to 1 fps when the picture is static": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画面静止时降到 1 fps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After about 5 seconds without a change, the PiP refreshes once a second until something moves again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画面约 5 秒没有变化后，小窗每秒只刷新一次，直到画面再次变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pause When Covered or on Another Desktop": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "被遮挡或不在当前桌面时暂停"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Per-App Frame Rate": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按 App 帧率"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps whose frame rate you change keep it; terminal and editor apps, Activity Monitor and Console start at 5 fps the first time. Every other app uses the Frame Rate above.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有你改过帧率的 app 会记住自己的帧率；终端、编辑器类 app 以及活动监视器、控制台第一次打开 PiP 时记为 5 fps；其余 app 都用上面选的默认值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No app has its own frame rate yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有单独设置帧率的 app。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove this app's frame rate": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除这个 app 的帧率记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A PiP that's completely covered by other windows or on another desktop drops to 1 fps until it's visible again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小窗被其他窗口完全遮挡或不在当前桌面时降到每秒 1 帧，重新可见后恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chromium Compatibility Mode": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chromium 兼容模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default. When a Chromium or Electron app stops redrawing off screen, PipDog only suggests turning this mode on. With it on, the note suggests reopening the app with --disable-backgrounding-occluded-windows. PipDog never restarts apps for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭。Chromium 或 Electron 应用在屏幕外停止重绘时，默认只提示去打开这个模式；打开后，提示才会建议带 --disable-backgrounding-occluded-windows 重新打开该 app。PipDog 不会替你重启任何 app。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for “%@” to restart\nThe PiP reconnects when its window is back": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待「%@」重启\n窗口回来后小窗会自动重新连上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” didn't come back, so the PiP ended": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」一直没有重新打开，小窗已关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” may stop redrawing while it's off screen. Quit it and reopen it with --disable-backgrounding-occluded-windows to keep the picture updating.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」在屏幕外时可能停止重绘。退出它，带 --disable-backgrounding-occluded-windows 重新打开，画面就能继续更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” may stop redrawing while it's off screen. Turn on Chromium Compatibility Mode in Settings to see how to reopen it yourself with a background-rendering switch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」在屏幕外时可能停止重绘。打开设置里的「Chromium 兼容模式」后，会告诉你如何自己带后台渲染参数重新打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The picture from “%@” seems stuck. PipDog already tried restarting the capture; moving the source window or reopening the app may help.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」的画面似乎卡住了。PipDog 已经尝试重新开始抓取；移动原窗口或重新打开该 app 可能会好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accessibility granted. Enhanced Mode is ready.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已获得辅助功能权限，增强模式可以使用了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accessibility was turned off, so Enhanced Mode isn't available. Turn PipDog back on in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Accessibility.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "辅助功能权限已被关闭，增强模式暂时不可用。请在系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 辅助功能中重新打开 PipDog"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click its icon for PiP, region capture and settings. This guide is in the menu too, under Show Getting Started.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点这个图标就能把窗口或区域变成小窗，也能打开设置。这份引导在菜单的「显示上手指引」里可以再看"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click to switch frame rate": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点一下切换帧率"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enhanced Mode": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "增强模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enhanced Mode needs Accessibility permission. Turn it on in System Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "增强模式需要「辅助功能」权限，请在系统设置中打开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enhanced Mode needs Accessibility. Turn on PipDog in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Accessibility.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "增强模式需要「辅助功能」权限。请在系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 辅助功能中打开 PipDog"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide on Hover is off": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "悬停时自动隐藏：关"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide on Hover is on": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "悬停时自动隐藏：开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default. Needs Accessibility: PipDog asks for it when you turn this on, and the shortcuts work once it's granted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭。需要「辅助功能」权限：打开开关时 PipDog 会请求授权，授权后快捷键立即可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pause": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂停"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Picture paused\nClick the play button in the toolbar to resume": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画面已暂停\n点顶部的播放按钮继续"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PipDog is in the menu bar": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PipDog 在菜单栏里"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Resume": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "继续"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show Getting Started": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示上手指引"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While the pointer rests on a PiP: = and - zoom, F switches the frame rate, D toggles the static-picture frame rate reduction, a tap of fn hides or shows the PiP, and ⌫ closes it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指针停在某个小窗上时：= 和 - 缩放，F 切换帧率，D 开关「画面静止时降到 1 fps」，轻点 fn 隐藏 / 显示小窗，⌫ 关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "fn+P PiPs the focused window and fn+⇧+P selects a region.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "fn+P 把最前面 app 的窗口变成小窗，fn+⇧+P 框选区域"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
